<p data-start=3D"1294" data-end=3D"1312"><strong data-start=3D"1294" data-e=
nd=3D"1310">How it works</strong></p>
<ul data-start=3D"1313" data-end=3D"1561">
<li data-start=3D"1313" data-end=3D"1406">
<p data-start=3D"1315" data-end=3D"1406">Tailwind=E2=80=99s <code data-star=
t=3D"1326" data-end=3D"1333">dark:</code> variant applies styles when <code=
 data-start=3D"1362" data-end=3D"1376">class=3D"dark"</code> is on the <cod=
e data-start=3D"1387" data-end=3D"1395">&lt;html&gt;</code> element.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1407" data-end=3D"1487">
<p data-start=3D"1409" data-end=3D"1487">The JavaScript stores the theme in=
 <code data-start=3D"1444" data-end=3D"1458">localStorage</code> so it stay=
s after refresh.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1488" data-end=3D"1561">
<p data-start=3D"1490" data-end=3D"1561">Default theme is based on the syst=
em preference if nothing is stored.</p>
</li>
</ul>
