<p data-start=3D"803" data-end=3D"822"><strong data-start=3D"803" data-end=
=3D"822">Why this works:</strong></p>
<ul data-start=3D"823" data-end=3D"1065">
<li data-start=3D"823" data-end=3D"896">
<p data-start=3D"825" data-end=3D"896"><code data-start=3D"825" data-end=3D=
"862">background-position: center center;</code> ensures the image center i=
s used.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"897" data-end=3D"962">
<p data-start=3D"899" data-end=3D"962"><code data-start=3D"899" data-end=3D=
"924">background-size: cover;</code> makes sure the image fills the space.<=
/p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"963" data-end=3D"1065">
<p data-start=3D"965" data-end=3D"1065"><code data-start=3D"965" data-end=
=3D"971">flex</code> with <code data-start=3D"977" data-end=3D"990">align-i=
tems</code> and <code data-start=3D"995" data-end=3D"1012">justify-content<=
/code> ensures any text/buttons inside are also centered.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"1067" data-end=3D"1165">If you want the <strong data-start=
=3D"1083" data-end=3D"1130">entire image fully visible without cropping</st=
rong>, replace <code data-start=3D"1140" data-end=3D"1147">cover</code> wit=
h <code data-start=3D"1153" data-end=3D"1162">contain</code>.</p>
