=3D"488">Key point:</strong></p>
<ul data-start=3D"489" data-end=3D"767">
<li data-start=3D"489" data-end=3D"567">
<p data-start=3D"491" data-end=3D"567"><code data-start=3D"491" data-end=3D=
"522">background-attachment: fixed;</code> keeps the image in place even if=
