</li>
<li data-start=3D"568" data-end=3D"645">
<p data-start=3D"570" data-end=3D"645"><code data-start=3D"570" data-end=3D=
"607">background-position: center center;</code> ensures the image is alway=
s centered.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"646" data-end=3D"767">
<p data-start=3D"648" data-end=3D"767">With <code data-start=3D"653" data-e=
