<hr data-start=3D"1983" data-end=3D"1986">
<h3 data-start=3D"1988" data-end=3D"2009"><strong data-start=3D"1992" data-=
end=3D"2009">How it works:</strong></h3>
<ul data-start=3D"2010" data-end=3D"2257">
<li data-start=3D"2010" data-end=3D"2108">
<p data-start=3D"2012" data-end=3D"2108">On <strong data-start=3D"2015" dat=
a-end=3D"2026">desktop</strong> (<code data-start=3D"2028" data-end=3D"2033=
">md:</code> breakpoint and up), the menu is visible, and the hamburger ico=
n is hidden.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2109" data-end=3D"2185">
<p data-start=3D"2111" data-end=3D"2185">On <strong data-start=3D"2114" dat=
a-end=3D"2124">mobile</strong>, the desktop menu is hidden, and the hamburg=
er icon appears.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2186" data-end=3D"2257">
<p data-start=3D"2188" data-end=3D"2257">Clicking the hamburger toggles the=
 <code data-start=3D"2223" data-end=3D"2231">hidden</code> class on the mob=
ile menu.</p>
</li>
</ul>
