<hr data-start=3D"1897" data-end=3D"1900">
<h3 data-start=3D"1902" data-end=3D"1921">=E2=9C=85 How it works:</h3>
<ol data-start=3D"1922" data-end=3D"2159">
<li data-start=3D"1922" data-end=3D"1978">
<p data-start=3D"1925" data-end=3D"1978">Hamburger toggles the <code data-s=
tart=3D"1947" data-end=3D"1954">.show</code> class =E2=86=92 menu slides in=
.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1979" data-end=3D"2055">
<p data-start=3D"1982" data-end=3D"2055">Clicking anywhere <strong data-sta=
rt=3D"2000" data-end=3D"2020">outside the menu</strong> removes <code data-=
start=3D"2029" data-end=3D"2036">.show</code> =E2=86=92 menu slides out.</p=
>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2056" data-end=3D"2159">
<p data-start=3D"2059" data-end=3D"2159"><code data-start=3D"2059" data-end=
=3D"2080">e.stopPropagation()</code> ensures the menu doesn=E2=80=99t immed=
iately close when clicking the hamburger itself.</p>
</li>
</ol>
<hr data-start=3D"2161" data-end=3D"2164">
<p data-start=3D"2166" data-end=3D"2311" data-is-last-node=3D"" data-is-onl=
y-node=3D"">If you want, I can also <strong data-start=3D"2190" data-end=3D=
"2234">animate the hamburger into a cross (=E2=80=9CX=E2=80=9D)</strong> wh=
