<hr data-start=3D"1265" data-end=3D"1268">
<h3 data-start=3D"1270" data-end=3D"1289">=E2=9C=85 How it works:</h3>
<ol data-start=3D"1290" data-end=3D"1538">
<li data-start=3D"1290" data-end=3D"1392">
<p data-start=3D"1293" data-end=3D"1392">Tailwind uses <code data-start=3D"=
1307" data-end=3D"1314">.dark</code> class to style elements in dark mode (=
<code data-start=3D"1353" data-end=3D"1371">dark:bg-gray-700</code>, <code =
data-start=3D"1373" data-end=3D"1390">dark:text-white</code>).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1393" data-end=3D"1465">
<p data-start=3D"1396" data-end=3D"1465">Clicking the toggle button adds/re=
moves the <code data-start=3D"1440" data-end=3D"1446">dark</code> class on =
<code data-start=3D"1456" data-end=3D"1464">&lt;html&gt;</code>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1466" data-end=3D"1538">
<p data-start=3D"1469" data-end=3D"1538">Optional: <code data-start=3D"1479=
" data-end=3D"1493">localStorage</code> remembers user preference across pa=
ge loads.</p>
</li>
</ol>
