<ol data-start=3D"1474" data-end=3D"1731">
<li data-start=3D"1474" data-end=3D"1545">
<p data-start=3D"1477" data-end=3D"1545">The checkbox is hidden but clickab=
le via the label (<code data-start=3D"1529" data-end=3D"1543">theme-toggle<=
/code>).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1546" data-end=3D"1632">
<p data-start=3D"1549" data-end=3D"1632">When checked, the sibling <code da=
ta-start=3D"1575" data-end=3D"1585">.content</code> changes background and =
text color =E2=86=92 dark mode.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1633" data-end=3D"1690">
<p data-start=3D"1636" data-end=3D"1690">The slider visually moves to indic=
ate the mode change.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1691" data-end=3D"1731">
<p data-start=3D"1694" data-end=3D"1731">Pure CSS: <strong data-start=3D"17=
04" data-end=3D"1730">no JavaScript required</strong>.</p>
</li>
</ol>
