<hr data-start=3D"4685" data-end=3D"4688">
<h3 data-start=3D"4690" data-end=3D"4710"><strong data-start=3D"4694" data-=
end=3D"4710">How it works</strong></h3>
<ol data-start=3D"4711" data-end=3D"5087">
<li data-start=3D"4711" data-end=3D"4799">
<p data-start=3D"4714" data-end=3D"4799">The <strong data-start=3D"4718" da=
ta-end=3D"4730">checkbox</strong> (<code data-start=3D"4732" data-end=3D"47=
51">#dark-mode-toggle</code>) is hidden and triggers dark mode when checked=
.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4800" data-end=3D"4957">
<p data-start=3D"4803" data-end=3D"4957">Using the <strong data-start=3D"48=
13" data-end=3D"4841">CSS sibling selector <code data-start=3D"4836" data-e=
nd=3D"4839">~</code></strong>, all main sections (header, hero, collections=
, about, contact, footer) change their <code data-start=3D"4926" data-end=
=3D"4944">background-color</code> and <code data-start=3D"4949" data-end=3D=
"4956">color</code>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4958" data-end=3D"5034">
<p data-start=3D"4961" data-end=3D"5034">Smooth transition is done via <cod=
e data-start=3D"4991" data-end=3D"5033">transition: background 0.4s, color =
0.4s;</code>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5035" data-end=3D"5087">
<p data-start=3D"5038" data-end=3D"5087">Cards inside collections also adap=
t to dark mode.</p>
</li>
</ol>
<hr data-start=3D"5089" data-end=3D"5092">
<p data-start=3D"5094" data-end=3D"5196">This is <strong data-start=3D"5102=
" data-end=3D"5120">fully pure CSS</strong>, smooth, and covers <strong dat=
a-start=3D"5141" data-end=3D"5163">all major sections</strong> for a premiu=
m fashion website.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"5198" data-end=3D"5201">
<p data-start=3D"5203" data-end=3D"5325">I can also <strong data-start=3D"5=
214" data-end=3D"5271">add the hamburger menu with this dark mode integrate=
d</strong> so mobile navigation works perfectly in both modes.</p>
