50" data-end=3D"1866">How it works</strong>:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"1870" data-end=3D"2134">
<li data-start=3D"1870" data-end=3D"1935">
<p data-start=3D"1872" data-end=3D"1935"><strong data-start=3D"1872" data-e=
nd=3D"1884">3 slides</strong> with background images for Men, Women, and Ki=
ds.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1936" data-end=3D"1982">
<p data-start=3D"1938" data-end=3D"1982">Each slide fades in &amp; out ever=
y 5 seconds.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1983" data-end=3D"2046">
<p data-start=3D"1985" data-end=3D"2046">Text overlay has its own <strong d=
ata-start=3D"2010" data-end=3D"2043">fade-in from bottom animation</strong>=
