<h3 data-start=3D"1023" data-end=3D"1040">How it works:</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"1041" data-end=3D"1277">
<li data-start=3D"1041" data-end=3D"1127">
<p data-start=3D"1043" data-end=3D"1127">The <strong data-start=3D"1047" da=
ta-end=3D"1065"><code data-start=3D"1049" data-end=3D"1063">:first-child</c=
ode></strong> selector targets the first card (<code data-start=3D"1099" da=
ta-end=3D"1111">Men's Wear</code>) =E2=86=92 moves right.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1128" data-end=3D"1217">
<p data-start=3D"1130" data-end=3D"1217">The <strong data-start=3D"1134" da=
ta-end=3D"1153"><code data-start=3D"1136" data-end=3D"1151">:nth-child(2)</=
code></strong> selector targets the second card (<code data-start=3D"1188" =
data-end=3D"1202">Woman's Wear</code>) =E2=86=92 moves left.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1218" data-end=3D"1277">
<p data-start=3D"1220" data-end=3D"1277"><code data-start=3D"1220" data-end=
=3D"1253">transition: transform 0.4s ease</code> makes the slide smooth.</p=
>
</li>
</ul>
