<h3 data-start=3D"1797" data-end=3D"1813">How it works</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"1814" data-end=3D"2124">
<li data-start=3D"1814" data-end=3D"1895">
<p data-start=3D"1816" data-end=3D"1895"><strong data-start=3D"1816" data-e=
nd=3D"1831">Grid layout</strong> arranges all images in a single row (<code=
 data-start=3D"1869" data-end=3D"1893">grid-auto-flow: column</code>).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1896" data-end=3D"1971">
<p data-start=3D"1898" data-end=3D"1971"><strong data-start=3D"1898" data-e=
nd=3D"1924">Duplicating the images</strong> ensures there=E2=80=99s no blan=
k gap during animation.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1972" data-end=3D"2060">
<p data-start=3D"1974" data-end=3D"2060"><strong data-start=3D"1974" data-e=
nd=3D"2000"><code data-start=3D"1976" data-end=3D"1988">translateX</code> a=
nimation</strong> moves the row from right to left infinitely and smoothly.=
</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2061" data-end=3D"2124">
<p data-start=3D"2063" data-end=3D"2124"><strong data-start=3D"2063" data-e=
nd=3D"2082">Overflow hidden</strong> on the section keeps the scrolling cle=
an.</p>
</li>
</ul>
