<hr data-start=3D"2002" data-end=3D"2005">
<h3 data-start=3D"2007" data-end=3D"2027">How This Works</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"2028" data-end=3D"2260">
<li data-start=3D"2028" data-end=3D"2096">
<p data-start=3D"2030" data-end=3D"2096"><code data-start=3D"2030" data-end=
=3D"2045">sponsor-track</code> holds <strong data-start=3D"2052" data-end=
=3D"2093">two identical <code data-start=3D"2068" data-end=3D"2082">sponsor=
-grid</code> sections</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2097" data-end=3D"2171">
<p data-start=3D"2099" data-end=3D"2171"><code data-start=3D"2099" data-end=
=3D"2118">translateX(-100%)</code> moves the first set out while the second=
 comes in.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2172" data-end=3D"2260">
<p data-start=3D"2174" data-end=3D"2260">Because they=E2=80=99re duplicates=
, it loops seamlessly without gaps or overflow scrollbars.</p>
</li>
</ul>
