<ul data-start=3D"1640" data-end=3D"1940">
<li data-start=3D"1640" data-end=3D"1726">
<p data-start=3D"1642" data-end=3D"1726">Each testimonial is displayed in a=
 <strong data-start=3D"1677" data-end=3D"1685">card</strong> with soft shad=
ows and rounded corners.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1727" data-end=3D"1789">
<p data-start=3D"1729" data-end=3D"1789">The profile image is <strong data-=
start=3D"1750" data-end=3D"1786">circular with a border highlight</strong>.=
</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1790" data-end=3D"1846">
<p data-start=3D"1792" data-end=3D"1846">Cards <strong data-start=3D"1798" =
data-end=3D"1818">lift up on hover</strong> with a smooth transition.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1847" data-end=3D"1940">
<p data-start=3D"1849" data-end=3D"1940">Responsive: the <code data-start=
=3D"1865" data-end=3D"1876">flex-wrap</code> ensures the cards wrap into mu=
ltiple rows on smaller screens.</p>
</li>
</ul>
